# Mutable runtime request state (not source data). Deployments start with empty stores; the agents
# recreate them. Shipping these makes replays conflict, because stored fingerprints embed timestamps
# from the original runs. data/input/returns_live/source.sqlite3 is source data and DOES ship.
data/input/pack/pack.sqlite3
data/input/prep/prep-requests.sqlite3
data/input/recovery/recovery.sqlite3
data/input/returns_live/state
